[{"title":"小祥之后，勉复弄笔梦游十二首 其十一","author":"王彦泓","text":"青鸟心忙未敢催，频频犹自怕人疑。\n明知炙盏烧灯久，无奈熏衣理鬓迟。\n良夜不甘闲处醉，美人须看月中姿。\n来时东向西归去，只有清光与面随。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30347,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小祥之后，勉复弄笔梦游十二首 其十二","author":"王彦泓","text":"小阑干外上轻舟，比舍无人见出游。\n香茗便携妆箧去，瓶铛原属榜人收。\n霜郊缟素鲜清晓，木叶丹黄绘晚秋。\n绣被鄂君仍眺赏，蓬窗新署远山楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30348,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句四首 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"佳期无奈锁严城，灯火窗扉望里明。\n难把玉人心事诉，监门不是古侯赢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30349,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句四首 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"池边五嫂笑相呼，问要鱼羹契也无。\n便信船中有桃叶，只因持楫是官奴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30350,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句四首 其三","author":"王彦泓","text":"卫玠肌肤杜牧神，谢娘诸弟各清真。\n肯沿绿帻庖人例，人主当筵问主人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30351,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句四首 其四","author":"王彦泓","text":"出没狂踪数日迷，传讹新事惑深闺。\n三姨误受君王谑，不道人间有达奚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30352,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"续游十二首 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"又到尊前一笑同，履綦经月断过从。\n难凭妒女违心语，便策良媒冒险功。\n独夜有时来好梦，欢筵无暇诉愁衷。\n火灯鉴妾丹诚在，一掷全呈六博红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30353,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"续游十二首 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"浪说鸧鹒疗妒方，笑他邢尹互迷藏。\n神仙底事私奇服，姊妹犹然忌体香。\n团扇风流何预嫂，绿翘冤抑况无郎。\n能将栀子连诗赠，只有徐娘与谢娘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30354,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"续游十二首 其三","author":"王彦泓","text":"斜背灯光笑眼抛，铜炉酒响荡明胶。\n柔肠拚与冠缨断，密绪原先履舄交。\n傅母殷勤心劝进，侍儿佻达语含嘲。\n此时何止看花宴，旷荡狂情似孟郊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30355,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"续游十二首 其四","author":"王彦泓","text":"银墙朱卢碧铜铺，个是清溪最小姑。\n红豆数来夸记曲，熏笼立上试轻躯。\n羞看董偃庖人服，笑许陈遵侍婢扶。\n清月照人香雾里，凭谁为写夜游图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30356,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"续游十二首 其五","author":"王彦泓","text":"细吐微词缓劝酬，口脂香暖流银瓯。\n杯行醉按红酥手，烛灭狂探软玉钩。\n出浴睡容梳薄鬓，下帷灯影照含羞。\n此身合属书生未，记取金梭莫再投。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30357,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"续游十二首 其六","author":"王彦泓","text":"独赴非烟折柬招，房栊楚楚径萧萧。\n茶炉活火添香炷，菊盎微泉上纸条。\n夜宴过秋方渐永，卯酣经午未全消。\n传卿月下为欢诀，小憩黄昏坐彻宵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30358,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"续游十二首 其七","author":"王彦泓","text":"华筵烛臭恼娇娆，茗碗持听月底箫。\n清露压衣沾暗麝，凉风吹颊散红潮。\n佛珠久换金缠臂，斗草新输玉系腰。\n邻女近裁靴样浅，月明相唤走红桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30359,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"续游十二首 其八","author":"王彦泓","text":"严城间阻梦魂通，小市门东更向东。\n剪烛寄声书草草，背灯弹泪去悤悤。\n花繁竹暗应迷路，蝶趁莺梢有便风。\n梅蕊胆瓶看渐减，每朝分插到钗丛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30360,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"续游十二首 其九","author":"王彦泓","text":"秋扇轻将屈戌敲，小楼窗槛在花梢。\n绣成枝上将雏鸟，画出花阴捕蝶猫。\n余语未终嗔姊到，艳词新记妮人钞。\n偶因背痒闲相就，愿乞神仙手一搔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30361,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"续游十二首 其十","author":"王彦泓","text":"矮榻幽窗一架书，到来闲适似吾庐。\n银瓶酒候知寒暖，石鼎茶声辨疾徐。\n却月晕眉看婢写，斜阳唏发替郎梳。\n情踪不似阶前叶，肯到秋来日渐疏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30362,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"续游十二首 其十一","author":"王彦泓","text":"矜严入座暗心通，酒力难催赛艳红。\n睡起髻鬟欹玉燕，欢余灯烬绽金虫。\n来时夜色霜千瓦，归路寒辉月一弓。\n有约试香还再到，抱衾先与覆熏笼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30363,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"续游十二首 其十二","author":"王彦泓","text":"清夜能游必慧人，泪垂红烛意堪亲。\n纸窗窄槛通新月，细蕊疏花验小春。\n戏掐枣膏添麝火，暗拈瓜子记杯巡。\n相思怨绝诗难写，却爱弹丝诉得真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30364,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得别梦依依到谢家八首 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"名花偏作隔墙枝，爱影怜声入手迟。\n门第敢言非道蕴，才情端喜是芳姿。\n桃边未许裙题字，柳下曾将带乞诗。\n今日眼波微动处，半通商略半矜持。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30365,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得别梦依依到谢家八首 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"惊喜冰颜一笑开，投梭时节已怜才。\n持裙暂肯临风住，刬袜还期映月来。\n沉水待烘欢夕座，真茶留瀹到时杯。\n书生金石心肠在，不借裁诗十字媒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30366,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得别梦依依到谢家八首 其三","author":"王彦泓","text":"月照幽期分外圆，无才愁赋定情篇。\n引开笑语欢初洽，逼出风情态转妍。\n略晓管弦嗔姊荐，乍回灯影恣人怜。\n狂生浪说心如渴，却到良宵不肯眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30367,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得别梦依依到谢家八首 其四","author":"王彦泓","text":"内家来看晓妆成，坐次推排让客卿。\n记到竹林曾识面，为翻花样久知名。\n语音略别东西宅，梳掠无分内外城。\n敢道向郎恩分浅，同群女伴尚关情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30368,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得别梦依依到谢家八首 其五","author":"王彦泓","text":"天壤王郎嗜好奇，能将野鹜压家鸡。\n花前密咒添香火，酒后柔肠著絮泥。\n宋祎昔为金谷女，绛仙曾是玉工妻。\n无妨暂属尘凡对，不过才人定也迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30369,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得别梦依依到谢家八首 其六","author":"王彦泓","text":"朱箔纱空画舫轻，月明波上载卿卿。\n尊前绰约身如燕，帐底朦胧语是莺。\n绛烛婢吹香未烬，卖花人唤梦初惊。\n颓鬟未拢凭栏久，偶爱跳鱼拨剌声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30370,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得别梦依依到谢家八首 其七","author":"王彦泓","text":"为有冲烟犯月郎，矜严标格渐成狂。\n何当白玉莲花盏，更带红鸾冶袖香。\n慧绝眼波频送语，喜来巾帔总飘扬。\n温柔乡里留欢住，不放情人到醉乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30371,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得别梦依依到谢家八首 其八","author":"王彦泓","text":"爱咏无题定有题，宋墙东畔谢楼西。\n封来泪点红犹湿，剪后香丝绿未齐。\n共被拥将宜主暖，闲床抛得阿侯啼。\n风流韵事堪描处，却到含毫思转迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30372,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别有所赠一首用前迷字韵","author":"王彦泓","text":"握臂登楼去却梯，乍谙情事齿还低。\n孀姝曲巷新名左，国艳扁舟旧姓西。\n髹鬓黑光全似镜，莲钩粉底不沾泥。\n端详烛下分明甚，不是看花醉眼迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30373,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即夕口占绝句十二首 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"裾飘屧响到寺墀，便遣萧郎不自持。\n天分未容人彷佛，酒边风味烛边姿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30374,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即夕口占绝句十二首 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"橄榄回甘沁齿牙，酒阑频嗅小梅花。\n悬知袖口罗巾上，乘却龙团一饼茶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30375,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即夕口占绝句十二首 其三","author":"王彦泓","text":"鸳被宽裁绣越罗，莲枝花样锦团窠。\n误教侍女熏龙脑，摺向闲床一月多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30376,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即夕口占绝句十二首 其四","author":"王彦泓","text":"睡情何处不相关，合度农纤语等闲。\n枕上不妨频转侧，柔腰偏解逐人弯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30377,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即夕口占绝句十二首 其五","author":"王彦泓","text":"斗帐香篝不漏烟，睡鞋暖窄困春眠。\n教郎被底摩挲过，忽见红帮露枕边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30378,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即夕口占绝句十二首 其六","author":"王彦泓","text":"梦回酒渴破漳柑，十月霜轻尚带酸。\n生受玉人绵样手，为郎频熨指尖寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30379,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即夕口占绝句十二首 其七","author":"王彦泓","text":"夜静莺哥叫隔屏，鬓香微嗅醉初醒。\n偶然枕上哦诗就，唤觉如花念与听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30380,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即夕口占绝句十二首 其八","author":"王彦泓","text":"青鸟丁宁辨色归，为贪清语梦来迟。\n朦胧倦睫开还闭，已是红窗日照时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30381,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即夕口占绝句十二首 其九","author":"王彦泓","text":"揽衣初起髻鬟倾，翠凤离披画不成。\n梳洗不妨停一刻，乱头时节最倾城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30382,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即夕口占绝句十二首 其十","author":"王彦泓","text":"磬口黄梅饷内家，明围暗压斗横斜。\n水仙独向钗头颤，第一人宜第一花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30383,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即夕口占绝句十二首 其十一","author":"王彦泓","text":"鬓影松松髻影低，镜中看镜掠初齐。\n金蝉玉燕都嫌俗，单插暹罗旧密犀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30384,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即夕口占绝句十二首 其十二","author":"王彦泓","text":"细楷香囊画睡鸳，来时曾记枕前安。\n传声为遣郎收拾，莫与兰闺女伴看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30385,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杪冬即事","author":"王彦泓","text":"曲宴偏宜素霰飘，一觞冬莫慰无聊。\n浓香衾枕寒偎鸭，炽炭房栊暖卸貂。\n谢女厌称风柳絮，王郎真见雪芭蕉。\n垂帘尽日慵梳掠，预为严妆怯岁朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30386,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏和子荆春闺六韵","author":"王彦泓","text":"懒得闲行懒得眠，眼波心事暗相牵。\n慵来午绣还添线，瘦去春衫未减绵。\n纤手自知搔背好，长眉谁见捧心妍。\n难传尺素墙东约，爱守炉熏砚北筵。\n已是雨惊佳梦夜，更堪花落病酲天。\n排愁只有郎诗卷，日课鹦哥念一篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30387,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子荆复倒压前韵一首亦复和之即以奉赠并呈端己韬仲子山诸叔及孝仪兄","author":"王彦泓","text":"孙楚新裁得几篇，倚楼吟断夕阳天。\n游装书画春风棹，饮令诗歌夜月筵。\n庭卉客怜双树好，瓶花自选一枝妍。\n炉烟细穟穿芸帙，砚沼微澜堕柳绵。\n绮语难从开士戒，朋欢不受内人牵。\n羡君兄弟皆好同，愿就连床听雨眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30388,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旧事 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"一回经眼一回妍，数见何须虑不鲜。\n目断座隅呼小玉，魂销墙隙赌非烟。\n佯推罚盏遮银烛，笑映疏帘并画船。\n蜂蝶似同人鉴赏，一春追遂遍花前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30389,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旧事 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"乍制春衫避藁砧，称腰宽窄赏知音。\n题书远饷膏唇药，卖赋聊储瞷浴金。\n三具明铛观妾意，七枚佳珥试君心。\n随郎十索寻常事，只有丁娘耐细吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30390,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题巾赠别 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"此际能无唤奈何，隔船斜见惨双蛾。\n伦回怨脸词难诉，欲掩啼痕泪转多。\n拥髻更谁怜好影，","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30391,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题巾赠别 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"持觞何日觑横波。\n情知此别三年远，欲乞题书半幅罗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30392,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金缕曲四首 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"东归青鸟报欢音，喜字回环寓意深。\n桃叶棹歌远隔水，灵芸辇路已标金。\n新欢郑重三熏沐，旧事迷藏七纵擒。\n此夜云英应一笑，笑郎消渴到如今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30393,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金缕曲四首 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"鸳鸯牒下喜难持，马角乌头尽有私。\n湘浦佩珠虽赠早，成都玉杵却来迟。\n难忘一世孤眠语，忍负千拦百就时。\n始信相思不无益，有情痴也未曾痴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30394,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金缕曲四首 其三","author":"王彦泓","text":"回首燕台浪寄闻，博山相约许湔裙。\n投符求辨驱红豆，倚醉犹能乞紫云。\n甘果掷来还并剖，名香窃去更同熏。\n市门妒女重相羡，不悔从前刺绣文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30395,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金缕曲四首 其四","author":"王彦泓","text":"钿车初下思安详，不似花阶钗袜忙。\n界泪粉痕新别姊，卸头灯影乍羞郎。\n谁云婢价输奴价，自认柔乡作婿乡。\n多谢向来持薄怒，为留欢味此宵尝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30396,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"劝驾词 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"小轩低向绿阴开，时有金衣啄砌苔。\n但少玉人闲伫立，垂杨丝下等卿来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30397,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"劝驾词 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"红罗小凤踏青鞋，量窄书生爱此杯。\n印出浅痕瓜子样，软苔香径等卿来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30398,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"劝驾词 其三","author":"王彦泓","text":"曾抽钗玉拨香灰，密笑初通媚眼回。\n一自暗传心事后，暖烧心字等卿来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30399,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"劝驾词 其四","author":"王彦泓","text":"瓠犀轻啮兔毫开，砚墨金彄照指皑。\n要看卫娘遒媚字，琉璃匣畔等卿来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30400,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"劝驾词 其五","author":"王彦泓","text":"笑颜曾见斗茶开，香染柔荑绿似苔。\n恰有紫茸香一饼，瓶笙声里等卿来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30401,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"劝驾词 其六","author":"王彦泓","text":"薄妆残醉倚郎怀，长看含葩髻上开。\n堪称色香俱第一，素馨花发等卿来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30402,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"劝驾词 其七","author":"王彦泓","text":"旧家花树夹庭阶，新寄书题乞药栽。\n为葺药房幽径里，竹窗梅槛等卿来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30403,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"劝驾词 其八","author":"王彦泓","text":"严闰无计散幽怀，山水同游梦几回。\n携取笔床茶灶去，画船烟雨等卿来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30404,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"劝驾词 其九","author":"王彦泓","text":"风波贝锦浪疑猜，一见须将怨险偎。\n知有一番拦抵在，浅嗔低骂等卿来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30405,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"劝驾词 其十","author":"王彦泓","text":"三年病渴愧无才，未得琼浆咽一杯。\n崖蜜乍尝今夜味，浓香细唾等卿来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30406,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"劝驾词 其十一","author":"王彦泓","text":"红窗女伴互推排，只要檀郎笑口开。\n况是可儿能不爱，尽消痴妒等卿来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30407,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"劝驾词 其十二","author":"王彦泓","text":"谁教倾国更怜才，问答曾凭七字媒。\n寄语高唐神女道，清词吟遍等卿来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30408,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病讯四章 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"无端娇病减琼姿，正压钿车欲驾时。\n欹枕避人窥玉镜，擎瓯无力搅银匙。\n啼多不损横波俊，意热偏令入手迟。\n知剩别离还少许，偿完从此镇追随。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30409,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病讯四章 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"绣被新鸳剩半床，怕拈卮酒怕闻香。\n能瘳别恨无灵药，愿驻华姿有禁方。\n背冷乍温教女弟，面痕轻舐待萧郎。\n悬知乍起新妆淡，只有葵花似嫩黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30410,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病讯四章 其三","author":"王彦泓","text":"浃旬音问阻铜墩，絮语娇啼入梦魂。\n蜂虿又衔新妒口，蝤蛴还啮旧欢痕。\n天教通德陪书幌，肯放夷光老苎村。\n何日下车身似燕，带香和笑到中门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30411,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病讯四章 其四","author":"王彦泓","text":"徐淑新题病起书，稍亲膏沐下庭除。\n一株明玉温泉里，两朵红酥映日初。\n承露远贻卿和药，避风停唤我持裾。\n啼绡一幅先封寄，免用灵芸玉唾壶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30412,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阿姚之归凡同心皆为予喜而向来知其事者端己韬仲叔也于其来贺赋谢一章","author":"王彦泓","text":"狂朋探喜到窗纱，敢袭宏家乐府夸。\n绣笼香烟荀令室，华灯髻影子于家。\n让山先识湔裙柳，白傅原知拂面花。\n惭愧月华诗思浅，只堪烹点密云茶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30413,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼欢","author":"王彦泓","text":"无才薄命不祥身，直遣凶灾到玉人。\n花骨未知何处葬，兰心长似小时醇。\n微酣不却郎行酒，半病还陪姊踏春。\n从此更难同一笑，泣看图画叫真真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":30414,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]